Checking court notices / legal cases is very important before starting construction. Below is a clear, step-by-step method, specific to Aloor-1, Chevella (Survey No. 212).

✅ 1️⃣ Encumbrance Certificate (EC) – First Level Check

This is the basic and mandatory check.

📍 Where: Sub-Registrar Office (SRO), Chevella
📄 Ask for:

EC from the first registration till today

Survey No. 212

✔ Shows:

Registered court attachments

Mortgages

Legal injunctions (if registered)

⚠️ Note: Some court cases may not appear in EC.

✅ 2️⃣ Telangana e-Courts Website (Direct Court Case Check)

This is the most important online check.

🔗 How to check:

Go to Telangana e-Courts portal

Select:

State: Telangana

District: Rangareddy

Court: Chevella (Junior Civil Judge / Senior Civil Judge)

Choose Case Search

Search by:

Survey No. 212

OR Village: Aloor-1

OR Previous owner name

✔ This shows:

Civil suits

Injunction / stay orders

Ongoing disputes

📌 Check both pending & disposed cases.

✅ 3️⃣ Tahsildar Office – Legal & Assigned Land Check

Visit Tahsildar, Chevella.

Ask for:

Assigned land verification

Court case / stay information

Government dispute status

They will check:

Revenue records

Prohibitory orders (Section 22-A, if any)

✅ 4️⃣ GP Office – Local Objection Check

At Aloor-1 Grama Panchayat, ask:

“Survey No. 212 meeda court stay / objections emaina unnaya?”

Check:

GP resolution book

Any stop construction notices

Public objections filed locally

✅ 5️⃣ Advocate Search (Strongly Recommended)

Give documents to a local property advocate (Chevella / Vikarabad side):

Sale deed

EC

ROR-1B

Layout approval

They will:

Do court database search

Check district court records

Give legal opinion (written)

🧾 What Documents to Carry While Checking

Sale Deed copy

EC copy

Survey No. 212 details

Layout plan copy

🚨 Red Flags to Watch For

❌ Any injunction / stay order
❌ Suit between co-owners
❌ Government vs private land case
❌ Road / open space dispute

If any of these appear → do not start construction.

🏁 Final Safe Path (Recommended Order)

1️⃣ EC (SRO Chevella)
2️⃣ e-Courts online search
3️⃣ Tahsildar verification
4️⃣ GP confirmation
5️⃣ Advocate legal opinion
